# Paper figures that notebook 10 writes beside itself when make_notebooks.py
# runs.  The versions that belong to the repository are the ones under
# img/gallery, which that script writes deliberately and which are tracked;
# these are the same plots saved a second time into the working directory,
# and `git add -A` after a regeneration will otherwise pick up all thirteen.
/notebooks/*.pdf
